		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:06,800",
				"to": "00:00:13,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 6800,
				"to": 13620
			},
			"text": " And spoiler alert, if you want to follow through the hunt as I search down and find the fault, watch the video first."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:13,700",
				"to": "00:00:18,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 13700,
				"to": 18020
			},
			"text": " Because this is a spoiler alert. You've been warned, okay? Because it's quite interesting."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:18,020",
				"to": "00:00:29,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 18020,
				"to": 29960
			},
			"text": " So, spoiler alert over with, the fault was that, yeah, we had a break in the power, the soft button power switch line here."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:30,060",
				"to": "00:00:36,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 30060,
				"to": 36520
			},
			"text": " So, the switch is on this side and then this goes off to the circuitry over here, which you can have a look at."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:36,580",
				"to": "00:00:40,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 36580,
				"to": 40660
			},
			"text": " Here it is here. So, this is the power key line coming in like this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:40,660",
				"to": "00:00:50,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 40660,
				"to": 50120
			},
			"text": " This comes over two ribbon cables plus six, no less than at least six jumper links to actually get to the point."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:50,240",
				"to": "00:00:53,700"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 50240,
				"to": 53700
			},
			"text": " And as well as a ferrite bead inductor, which is over here like this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,980",
				"to": "00:00:59,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53980,
				"to": 59060
			},
			"text": " And that goes to one side and then the other side of the switch just goes down to ground."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:59,620",
				"to": "00:01:04,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 59620,
				"to": 64360
			},
			"text": " That's it. So, yeah, this is the actual signal here."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:04,480",
				"to": "00:01:08,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 64480,
				"to": 68180
			},
			"text": " So, I got to thinking like, look at this, right?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:08,180",
				"to": "00:01:18,060"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 68180,
				"to": 78060
			},
			"text": " I've only really seen a break like this on like a bare board PCB where there's been an over etching problem, for example."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:18,200",
				"to": "00:01:20,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 78200,
				"to": 80800
			},
			"text": " Happens all the time. Like, you know, common as mud, really."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:21,220",
				"to": "00:01:29,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 81220,
				"to": 89180
			},
			"text": " That's why they do electrical testing on your bare board PCBs to check that there's no breaks in the PCBs like this from over etching."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,280",
				"to": "00:01:29,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89280,
				"to": 89480
			},
			"text": " So, that's it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,480",
				"to": "00:01:29,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89480,
				"to": 89500
			},
			"text": " So, yeah, this is the actual signal here."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,500",
				"to": "00:01:29,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89500,
				"to": 89500
			},
			"text": " So, I got to thinking like, look at this, right?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,500",
				"to": "00:01:33,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89500,
				"to": 93440
			},
			"text": " Now, of course, the rubber membrane came through here like this."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:33,540",
				"to": "00:01:37,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 93540,
				"to": 97640
			},
			"text": " The rubber membrane keypad over here came through."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:37,720",
				"to": "00:01:41,540"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 97720,
				"to": 101540
			},
			"text": " But look, there's no damage to any of the other traces here."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:41,700",
				"to": "00:01:46,180"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 101700,
				"to": 106180
			},
			"text": " You can see that there's maybe a slight rubbing mark on that one there."
