		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:49,560",
				"to": "00:01:59,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 109560,
				"to": 119480
			},
			"text": " So, why is that power trace and only the power trace got this huge chunk of copper taken out?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:59,480",
				"to": "00:02:04,500"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 119480,
				"to": 124500
			},
			"text": " And well, okay, and I speculated that, oh, this is a party box speaker."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:04,640",
				"to": "00:02:05,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 124640,
				"to": 125620
			},
			"text": " Somebody else at a party."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:05,720",
				"to": "00:02:07,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 125720,
				"to": 127520
			},
			"text": " Somebody spilled some beer on it or whatever."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:07,920",
				"to": "00:02:12,300"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 127920,
				"to": 132300
			},
			"text": " And, you know, and the beer got in here and it started to erode the trace away."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:12,460",
				"to": "00:02:14,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 132460,
				"to": 134000
			},
			"text": " Okay, fine."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:14,100",
